# Mermaid Syntax Rules (.mdc)

This file summarizes key Mermaid syntax rules used in this project.

## General

*   Comments: `%% comment text`
*   Direction: `direction TD` (Top-Down), `direction LR` (Left-Right)
*   Escaping Text: Enclose text with special characters (e.g., `?`, `%`, `()`, `{}`) in double quotes `"`. For tricky characters within quotes (like `"` itself), use HTML entity codes (e.g., `&quot;`, `#35;`).
*   Text: use proper html special chars escaping - or simply minimize usage of these

## Class Diagrams (`classDiagram`)

*   **Classes:**
    *   `class ClassName`
    *   `class ClassName {
        +publicMember: type
        -privateMember
        #protectedMember
        ~packageMember
        +method(arg: type): returnType
        +abstractMethod()* : type
        +staticMethod()$
        -staticField$
      }`
    *   Label: `class "Identifier" Label` or `class Identifier["Label Text"]` (Use simple IDs where possible)
    *   Generic Type: `ClassName~T~` or `member: List~int~`
*   **Relationships:**
    *   Inheritance: `<|--`
    *   Composition: `*--`
    *   Aggregation: `o--`
    *   Association: `-->` or `<--`
    *   Link (Solid): `--`
    *   Dependency: `..>` or `<..`
    *   Realization: `..|>` or `<|..`
    *   Link (Dashed): `..`
*   **Relationship Labels & Cardinality:**
    *   `ClassA "cardinality1" --> "cardinality2" ClassB : label text`
*   **Annotations:**
    *   `<<Interface>> ClassName`
    *   `class ClassName {
          <<Annotation>>
        }`
*   **Namespaces:**
    *   `namespace Outer {
          class Inner {}
        }`

## Sequence Diagrams (`sequenceDiagram`)

*   **Participants:** `participant Alias as Description` or `participant Name`
*   **Messages:**
    *   Solid line, solid arrow: `A->>B: Message Text`
    *   Dashed line, solid arrow: `A-->>B: Message Text`
    *   Solid line, open arrow: `A->B: Message Text`
    *   Dashed line, open arrow: `A-->B: Message Text`
*   **Activation/Deactivation:**
    *   `activate Participant`
    *   `deactivate Participant`
*   **Notes:**
    *   `Note right of A: Text`
    *   `Note left of A: Text`
    *   `Note over A: Text`
    *   `Note over A,B: Text`
*   **Loops, Alts, Opts:**
    *   `loop Text
        A->>B: Message
      end`
    *   `alt Condition1
        A->>B: Message
      else Condition2
        A->>C: Message
      end`
    *   `opt Text
        A->>B: Message
      end`

## Flowcharts (`flowchart TD` or `flowchart LR`)

*   **Nodes:**
    *   Default (rectangle): `id[Text]`
    *   Rounded rectangle: `id(Text)`
    *   Stadium shape: `id([Text])`
    *   Subroutine shape: `id[[Text]]`
    *   Cylindrical: `id[(Text)]`
    *   Circle: `id((Text))`
    *   Rhombus (decision): `id{Text}`
    *   Hexagon: `id{{Text}}`
*   **Links:**
    *   Arrow: `A --> B`
    *   Open link: `A --- B`
    *   Text on link: `A -- Text --> B` or `A ---|Text| B`
    *   Thick link: `A ==> B`
    *   Dotted link: `A -.-> B`
    *   Text on dotted link: `A -. Text .-> B`
*   **Subgraphs:**
    *   `subgraph Title
        id1 --> id2
      end`
